ptures an artist at a crossroads, documenting a year of risk, reinvention, and self-discovery as LISA begins to define not only her next chapter, but the woman and artist she wants to become.","certificate":"15","casting":["Lalisa Manobal"],"direction":["Sue Kim (II)"],"coDirection":[],"pictures":["https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/37/32/3732fd82bc5d97a4d9ecbd1f5287cba1.jpg","https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a4/f9/a4f96653738260f957f811e12fe4b6ec.jpg"],"heroImages":["https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/29736a0ce0edc187dc43042c5abeca7b.jpg"],"release":"2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","advisory":"very strong language","trailer":{"SD":null,"HD":null},"localizations":[],"studio":{"name":"Trafalgar Releasing"},"orderIndex":63}]